<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-E group results for 1996.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-E group results for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektromontaz Export group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit		   0.68   vs    1.96 loss</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit		     3.87   vs    3.08</p>
<p>    group net profit			   6.60   vs    5.06</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Elektromontaz Export SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales			   43.35   vs   29.25</p>
<p>    group costs of sales		    37.09   vs   24.10</p>
<p>    group extraordinary profit	     0.02   vs    0.03 loss</p>
<p>    group income tax			   0.73   vs    0.30</p>
<p>    group other taxes			  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		 2.75   vs    4.52</p>
<p>    group financial costs		    3.00   vs    1.69</p>
<p>    group investment			  11.40   vs    4.69</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
